# Digio - SALE response (A1), approved.
# Tags from §5.4.2.1. Approved is response code 100 on tag 22 - three
#   characters, not 00.
# On THIS action the TID is tag 13 and the MID tag 14. On an A3 they are 16
#   and 17, and 13 means Ref3. That is why the parser has a table per action.
# Tag 09 is a masked card number and tag 0A a cardholder name, both carried
#   here so the adapter is seen keeping four digits of one and none of the
#   other. The card number is a placeholder.
# Source: Digio "A920 Link-PoS-Spec" v2.21 (20 Oct 2025), section numbers as
#   printed there.
# Framing per §4: [3E 55][BER length][content][XOR CRC over header..content].
# THE CRC IS GENERATED, NEVER COPIED: seven of the ten complete frames the
#   document prints carry a CRC its own §4 rule does not produce.
